window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The bitter taste of treachery mars what should be a triumph.</b></p> <p>Morale is low as the allied forces recover from betrayal, loss and worrying news from the south. Elder Vanarr is in trouble.</p> <p>The northern Host was thrown back, but the war isn’t over, and an old enemy has returned once more. Devastation spreads and there are many who will seek opportunity within the chaos.</p> <p><b>Victory can still be achieved, if they are willing to bear the cost.</b></p>"; 
